  {"date": "2025-04-27", "venue": "Hollywood Bowl", "city": "Hollywood", "state": "CA", "gap": 6, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Tight, exploratory version that wastes no time. An early stop-start section (replete\nwith Trey's careening sirens blocking out \"woos\") takes hold, before an excellent \nkey change leads to an (at times) polytonal synth-rich romp with top-notch \ninterplay. \"KDF\"'s DNA starts to slowly re-emerge before the jam melts from the \nsong's traditional ending > \"Lifeboy\".", "out": ">", "prev": "Twist", "in": ">", "next": "Lifeboy", "nb": 1},
